<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title><%= title %> - Murena's Students Library</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
    <main class="container notices-page">
      <section class="notice-banner card">
        <div class="notice-banner__content">
          <span class="badge badge-soft">Academic Year 2025 / 2026</span>
          <h1><%= title %></h1>
          <p class="text-muted">
            Stay on top of key registration deadlines, required documents, and payment milestones. Check this page frequently—updates are posted as soon as Registrar’s Office publishes new notices.
          </p>
          <div class="notice-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-light" href="/info/enquiry">Contact Admissions</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="notice-banner__dates">
          <div class="notice-banner__dates-item">
            <span class="label">Undergraduate</span>
            <strong>14 Oct – 08 Nov</strong>
            <small>Online registration window</small>
          </div>
          <div class="notice-banner__dates-item">
            <span class="label">Postgraduate</span>
            <strong>21 Oct – 15 Nov</strong>
            <small>Late penalties begin 18 Nov</small>
          </div>
          <div class="notice-banner__dates-item">
            <span class="label">Fee Clearance</span>
            <strong>28 Nov</strong>
            <small>Deadline to confirm payment plans</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="card notices-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Current Registration Notices</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">Issued by the Registrar’s Department · Last updated <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB') %></p>
        </div>

        <div class="notice-grid">
          <article class="notice-card">
            <header>
              <h3>Freshman &amp; Transfer Students</h3>
              <span class="badge badge-info">New</span>
            </header>
            <ul>
              <li>Upload certified copies of ID, academic transcripts, and offer letter before completing online forms.</li>
              <li>Book your physical verification slot via the Admissions portal—slots fill up quickly.</li>
              <li>All freshmen must attend the orientation briefing on <strong>4 November</strong> in the Great Hall.</li>
            </ul>
            <footer>
              <a href="mailto:admissions@nust.ac.zw">Need help? admissions@nust.ac.zw</a>
            </footer>
          </article>

          <article class="notice-card">
            <header>
              <h3>Returning Students</h3>
              <span class="badge badge-warning">Action Required</span>
            </header>
            <ul>
              <li>Clear outstanding library fines and accommodation balances before attempting online registration.</li>
              <li>Course add/drop period ends <strong>15 November</strong>; faculty approval is required for late amendments.</li>
              <li>Ensure your departmental advisor signs off on the study plan prior to fee clearance.</li>
            </ul>
            <footer>
              <a href="mailto:studentaccounts@nust.ac.zw">Check clearance status</a>
            </footer>
          </article>

          <article class="notice-card">
            <header>
              <h3>International Students</h3>
              <span class="badge badge-success">Reminder</span>
            </header>
            <ul>
              <li>Submit valid study permit and passport copies through the International Office portal.</li>
              <li>Medical insurance proof must be uploaded before system unlocks course registration.</li>
              <li>Contact the International Office for assistance with visa renewals and travel letters.</li>
            </ul>
            <footer>
              <a href="mailto:international@nust.ac.zw">international@nust.ac.zw</a>
            </footer>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="card notices-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Registration Checklist</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">Follow each step in order to avoid delays.</p>
        </div>

        <ol class="notice-steps">
          <li>
            <h4>Confirm Fee Status</h4>
            <p>Retrieve invoice from the Student Accounts portal, verify payments, and arrange a plan if needed.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h4>Update Personal Details</h4>
            <p>Log into the student portal, review contact information, and upload any missing identification documents.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h4>Select Courses Online</h4>
            <p>Use the e-Register system to add courses. Save and submit for your department advisor to approve.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h4>Print Confirmation Slip</h4>
            <p>After approval, print the registration confirmation slip and keep a PDF copy for your records.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="card notices-section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Need Assistance?</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">Popular help lines during registration rush.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="notice-help">
          <div>
            <strong>Registrar’s Helpdesk</strong>
            <p>+263-29-2282842 ext 2404 / 2403 · <a href="mailto:registrar@nust.ac.zw">registrar@nust.ac.zw</a></p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Student Accounts</strong>
            <p>+263-29-2282842 ext 2295 / 2522 / 2663 · <a href="mailto:studentaccounts@nust.ac.zw">studentaccounts@nust.ac.zw</a></p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>ICT Support</strong>
            <p>+263-29-2282842 ext 2245 · <a href="mailto:icts@nust.ac.zw">icts@nust.ac.zw</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
